        "physical_scope": "Interior compositions of finitely many C1 intensive phase branches with energy, volume, all listed species exchanges, and internal reactions allowed in every phase, at a solution where the combined coexistence-and-affinity Jacobian has a nonsingular minor; phase amounts, boundaries, singular critical points, and externally fixed variables are excluded.",
