        "statement": "Let $X=\\{0,1\\}$ have energies $E(0)=0$ J and $E(1)=\\epsilon$ J with $\\epsilon>0$, both weights $g_i=1$, and $\\beta=(k_BT)^{-1}>0$ in $\\mathrm{J^{-1}}$. This is one finite-state model from [[def-td-thermodynamic-limit-contract]] and [[def-tdmath-countable-canonical-model]]. Its partition sum and free energy are\n\\[\nZ(\\beta)=1+e^{-\\beta\\epsilon},\\qquad F(\\beta)=-\\beta^{-1}\\log(1+e^{-\\beta\\epsilon}).\n\\]",
