        "inventory_expansion_required": false,
        "statement": "Adopt the reduced van der Waals equation as a phenomenological model:\n\\[\np(v,t)=\\frac{8t}{3v-1}-\\frac{3}{v^2},\\qquad v>\\frac13,\\quad t>0,\n\\]\nwhere $p=P/P_c$, $v=V/V_c$, and $t=T/T_c$ use positive model scales $P_c,V_c,T_c$. The equation is a model premise; its extension to liquid-like densities is not a universal physical law.",
